    "### Posterior Predictive Check\n",
    "\n",
    "Compare the predicted observables ($kT$, $L_X$) from the posterior to the observed values.\n",
    "This verifies the models actually reproduce the spectral data, and shows the per-observable\n",
    "$\\chi^2$ contribution."
   ]
